{"id":"d45c90153d8ba06e","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-degree-finite-generation-gap.md","title":"Finite Sigma-1 and Pi-1 Joins Do Not Generate All Degrees","display":"thm-degree-finite-generation-gap — Finite Sigma-1 and Pi-1 Joins Do Not Generate All Degrees","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-degree-finite-generation-gap","aliases":["67-thm-degree-finite-generation-gap"],"display":"thm-degree-finite-generation-gap — Finite Sigma-1 and Pi-1 Joins Do Not Generate All Degrees","depends_on":["[[67-df-degree-finite-generation]]","[[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf","source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","source_chapter":"7","source_label":"Theorems 7.12 and 7.13; closure observation before Theorem 7.12","source_printed_pages":[106,107,108],"source_pdf_pages":[117,118,119],"verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source-statement-and-book-argument-read; auxiliary proof chain not independently reconstructed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-degree-finite-generation-gap"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-degree-finite-generation-gap</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-degree-finite-generation-gap — Finite Sigma-1 and Pi-1 Joins Do Not Generate All Degrees"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed21199fbef98411\" href=\"?note=ed21199fbef98411\" title=\"67-df-degree-finite-generation\">67-df-degree-finite-generation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ff6c9f71377d6d7\" href=\"?note=4ff6c9f71377d6d7\" title=\"67-thm-interpretability-lattice\">67-thm-interpretability-lattice</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorems 7.12 and 7.13; closure observation before Theorem 7.12"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>106</span><span>107</span><span>108</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>117</span><span>118</span><span>119</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-statement-and-book-argument-read; auxiliary proof chain not independently reconstructed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,D_T,\\mathsf E_T,\\mathsf F_T,\\mathsf P_T\">\\(T,D_T,\\mathsf E_T,\\mathsf F_T,\\mathsf P_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ed21199fbef98411\" href=\"?note=ed21199fbef98411\" title=\"67-df-degree-finite-generation\">67-df-degree-finite-generation</a> 及其引用的复杂度类。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_T\">\\(\\wedge_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ff6c9f71377d6d7\" href=\"?note=4ff6c9f71377d6d7\" title=\"67-thm-interpretability-lattice\">67-thm-interpretability-lattice</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a,b\\in\\mathsf E_T\\;(a\\wedge_Tb\\in\\mathsf E_T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a,b\\in\\mathsf E_T\\;(a\\wedge_Tb\\in\\mathsf E_T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf P_T\\setminus\\mathsf E_T\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf P_T\\setminus\\mathsf E_T\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf E_T\\subsetneq\\mathsf F_T\\subsetneq D_T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf E_T\\subsetneq\\mathsf F_T\\subsetneq D_T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书印刷106页/PDF117页的闭交观察与定理12，以及印刷107–108页/PDF118–119页定理13的陈述和构造。第一式由分配律和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 度对有限交封闭推出；第二式是定理12，因每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 度都在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf F_T\">\\(\\mathsf F_T\\)</span> 中，得到第一处真包含；第二处真包含是定理13。</p>\n<p>这不是说低复杂度代表不足以表示每个度：每个度有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_2\">\\(\\Delta_2\\)</span> 单句代表已经由定理8给出。这里限制的是用有限交并操作从指定类生成。来源证明依赖复杂的部分保守性构造和任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 句集的加强不封顶关系，本轮仅阅读来源论证，未独立重建全部辅助链。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-degree-finite-generation","status":"resolved","id":"ed21199fbef98411","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-finite-generation]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-interpretability-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"4ff6c9f71377d6d7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-finite-generation","status":"resolved","id":"ed21199fbef98411","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\mathsf E_T,\\mathsf F_T,\\mathsf P_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-finite-generation]] 及其引用的复杂度类。","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-interpretability-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"4ff6c9f71377d6d7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\wedge_T$ 采用 [[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T,D_T,\\mathsf E_T,\\mathsf F_T,\\mathsf P_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall a,b\\in\\mathsf E_T\\;(a\\wedge_Tb\\in\\mathsf E_T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf P_T\\setminus\\mathsf E_T\\ne\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf E_T\\subsetneq\\mathsf F_T\\subsetneq D_T.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf F_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false}],"bytes":2169,"backlinks":[{"id":"ed21199fbef98411","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这里讨论的是解释度格的并，不是代表句的析取，也不是公理集并。原书定理12、13给出这两种生成方式的限制，见 [[67-thm-degree-finite-generation-gap]]。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-111","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-degree-finite-generation-gap]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-60","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]；[[../67-thm-degree-splitting-density]]；[[../67-df-degree-complexity]]；[[../67-thm-degree-delta2]]；[[../67-df-degree-pseudocomplement]]；[[../67-df-degree-cupping-capping]]；[[../67-df-degree-high-low]]；[[../67-df-degree-reduction-principle]]；[[../67-thm-degree-infinitary-distributivity]]；[[../67-thm-degree-finite-generation-gap]]"}],"outgoing":["ed21199fbef98411","4ff6c9f71377d6d7"]}